an boshlanadi."},{"opts":["drink","drinks","drinking","drank"],"q":"I ___ coffee in the morning.","ans":"drink","expl":"I olmoshi bilan fe'l o'zgarmaydi."}],"roomKey":"TOS-NPY8-RNQ6-WYA2","teacherName":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","hwMcqs":[{"opts":["go","goes","going","gone"],"expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (he/she/it) uchun fe'lga -es qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi.","ans":"goes","q":"My brother ______ to school every morning."},{"expl":"Ko'plik shakli (they) uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","ans":"study","q":"They ______ English at the university.","opts":["study","studies","studying","studied"]},{"opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"expl":"You olmoshi bilan so'roq gaplarda 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi.","ans":"Do","q":"______ you like apples?"},{"opts":["do","does","is","are"],"ans":"does","expl":"Inkor gaplarda uchinchi shaxs birlik uchun 'does not' ishlatiladi.","q":"She ______ not play football."},{"q":"My father ______ a doctor.","expl":"Birlikdagi shaxs uchun 'to be' fe'lining 'is' shakli qo'llaniladi.","ans":"is","opts":["be","am","is","are"]},{"expl":"We (biz) ko'plikda bo'lgani uchun fe'lga qo'shimcha qo'shilmaydi.","ans":"eat","q":"We ______ breakfast at 8 o'clock.","opts":["eat","eats","eating","eaten"]},{"q":"______ she live in Tashkent?","ans":"Does","expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (she) uchun so'roq gap 'does' bilan boshlanadi.","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"]},{"opts":["do","does","doing","done"],"q":"I ______ my homework every evening.","ans":"do","expl":"I (men) olmoshi uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi."},{"q":"The sun ______ in the east.","ans":"rises","expl":"Tabiat hodisalari va doimiy faktlar uchun uchinchi shaxs birlikda -s qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi.","opts":["rise","rises","rising","risen"]},{"ans":"do","expl":"They (ular) ko'plik olmoshi bo'lgani uchun inkor gapda 'do not' ishlatiladi.","q":"They ______ not watch TV at night.","opts":["do","does","is","are"]}],"name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","enrolledStudents":[],"blanks":[{"s":"She ______ (work) in a bank.","a":"works"},{"s":"They ______ (play) tennis every Sunday.","a":"play"},{"a":"Does","s":"______ (do) he speak English?"},{"a":"do not like","s":"I ______ (not/like) spicy food."},{"s":"The train ______ (arrive) at 9 AM.","a":"arrives"},{"a":"visit","s":"We ______ (visit) our grandparents often."},{"s":"______ (do) you want some water?","a":"Do"},{"a":"does not go","s":"He ______ (not/go) to the gym."},{"s":"My sister ______ (read) many books.","a":"reads"},{"a":"live","s":"They ______ (live) in a big house."}],"teacherUsername":"@axror","topic":"Present Simple","translations":[{"hint":"(I, wake up, every morning, at 7)","uz":"Men har kuni ertalab soat 7 da uyg'onaman."},{"hint":"(He, know, English, well)","uz":"U (o'g'il bola) ingliz tilini yaxshi biladi."},{"uz":"Biz dam olish kunlari kinoga bormaymiz.","hint":"(We, not go, to the cinema, on weekends)"},{"uz":"Siz maktabda o'qiysizmi?","hint":"(Do, you, study, at school)"},{"uz":"Mening onam mazali ovqat pishiradi.","hint":"(My mother, cook, delicious food)"},{"uz":"Ular parkda yugurishni yoqtirishadi.","hint":"(They, like, running, in the park)"},{"hint":"(She, read, a book, every day)","uz":"U (qiz bola) har kuni kitob o'qiydi."},{"uz":"Bizning mushugimiz sut ichmaydi.","hint":"(Our cat, not drink, milk)"},{"hint":"(Where, do, you, work)","uz":"Siz qayerda ishlaysiz?"},{"uz":"Ular har yili yozda dam olishadi.","hint":"(They, have a rest, every summer)"}],"essayPrompt":"O'zingizning kundalik tartibingiz haqida 8-10 ta gap yozing. Har kuni nimalar qilishingizni tasvirlab bering. Masalan: soat nechida uyg'onasiz, nimalar yeyishni yoqtirasiz, maktabga qanday borasiz va bo'sh vaqtingizda nimalar bilan shug'ullanasiz. 'Present Simple' qoidalariga rioya qiling. Gaplaringizni 'I wake up...', 'I eat...', 'I go...' kabi boshlang. O'zingizning maqsadlaringiz haqida ham yozib o'ting. Matnni xatosiz yozishga harakat qiling.","deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","teacherChatId":"6315515792","reorderItems":[{"correct":"He reads books every day.","words":["every","day","he","reads","books"]},{"words":["do","you","like","coffee"],"correct":"Do you like coffee?"},{"words":["not","she","does","eat","meat"],"correct":"She does not eat meat."}],"rules":[{"title":"Uchinchi shaxs qoidasi","desc":"He, She, It olmoshlari bilan fe'lga -s yoki -es qo'shiladi.","examples":["He reads a book.","She watches TV."]},{"desc":"Does ishlatilganda fe'ldagi -s/-es tushib qoladi.","title":"Inkor va so'roqda o'zgarish","examples":["Does he work? (not works)","He doesn't work."]}],"slides":[{"title":"Present Simple nima?","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;'><h3 style='color: #38bdf8;'>Doimiy takrorlanadigan ish-harakatlar</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Present Simple — bu bizning kundalik odatlarimiz, umumiy haqiqatlar va doimiy holatlarni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladigan zamon.</p><div style='background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;'><b>Misol:</b> I drink coffee every morning. (Men har kuni ertalab qahva ichaman.)</div></div>","tag":"Slide 1: Kirish"},{"title":"Tasdiq shakli (Affirmative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #6ee7b7;'>Formula: Subject + Verb (+s/es)</h3><ul style='color: #f1f5f9;'><li>I / You / We / They + <b>work</b></li><li>He / She / It + <b>works</b></li></ul><p style='color: #94a3b8;'>Eslatma: Uchinchi shaxs birlikda (He, She, It) fe'lga <b>-s</b> yoki <b>-es</b> qo'shiladi.</p></div>","tag":"Slide 2: Formula"},{"title":"Inkor shakli (Negative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fb7185;'>Yordamchi fe'llar: do not / does not</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Inkor yasash uchun <b>do not (don't)</b> yoki <b>does not (doesn't)</b> ishlatamiz.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>I don't like apples.</b><br><b>She doesn't like apples.</b></div></div>","tag":"Slide 3: Inkor"},{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fbbf24;'>Do / Does gap boshiga chiqadi</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Savol berish uchun gap boshiga <b>Do</b> yoki <b>Does</b> qo'yiladi.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>Do you speak English?</b><br><b>Does he play football?</b></div></div>","tag":"Slide 4: So'roq","title":"So'roq shakli (Interrogative)"},{"tag":"Slide 5: Kalit so'zlar","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #a5b4fc;'>Present Simple'ni qanday aniqlaymiz?</h3><ul style='color: #e2e8f0;'><li>Always (har doim)</li><li>Usually (odatda)</li><li>Often (tez-tez)</li><li>Sometimes (ba'zida)</li><li>Every day (har kuni)</li></ul></div>","title":"Vaqt ko'rsatkichlari"},{"title":"Amaliyot vaqti!","tag":"Slide 6: Xulosa","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;'><h3 style='color: #ffffff;'>Endi navbat sizga!</h3><p style='color: #cbd5e1;'>O'z kundalik odatlaringiz haqida 5 ta gap tuzing. Masalan: 'I wake up at 7 o'clock'.</p><button style='background: #6366f1; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px;'>Mashqlarni boshlash</button></div>"}],"questionsPrompt":"Ustozingizga 'Present Simple' mavzusida tushunmagan yoki qiziqtirgan kamida 2 ta savolingizni yozing.","flashcards":[{"pos":"Adverb","uzEx":"Men har doim o'qiyman.","enEx":"I always study.","word":"Always","uz":"Har doim"},{"uz":"Odatda","word":"Usually","enEx":"I usually sleep early.","pos":"Adverb","uzEx":"Men odatda erta uxlayman."},{"enEx":"They drink water.","uzEx":"Ular suv ichishadi.","pos":"Verb","word":"Drink","uz":"Ichmoq"},{"word":"Work","uzEx":"U qattiq ishlaydi.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"He works hard.","uz":"Ishlamoq"},{"uz":"O'ynamoq","word":"Play","uzEx":"Biz shaxmat o'ynaymiz.","pos":"Verb","enEx":"We play chess."},{"uz":"Har kuni","word":"Every day","uzEx":"Men har kuni yuguraman.","pos":"Phrase","enEx":"I run every day."},{"word":"Like","enEx":"She likes cats.","uzEx":"U mushuklarni yoqtiradi.","pos":"Verb","uz":"Yoqtirmoq"},{"uz":"Bormoq","word":"Go","enEx":"He goes to school.","uzEx":"U maktabga boradi.","pos":"Verb"},{"uz":"O'qimoq","enEx":"They study English.","uzEx":"Ular ingliz tilini o'rganishadi.","pos":"Verb","word":"Study"},{"uz":"Yemoq","word":"Eat","enEx":"I eat lunch at 1pm.","uzEx":"Men tushlikni soat 1 da yeyman.","pos":"Verb"},{"word":"Live","pos":"Verb","uzEx":"Biz Toshkentda yashaymiz.","enEx":"We live in Tashkent.","uz":"Yashamoq"},{"uz":"O'qimoq","word":"Read","enEx":"He reads news.","uzEx":"U yangiliklarni o'qiydi.","pos":"Verb"}],"errors":["He play football every day -> ✅ He plays football every day (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","Do she like coffee? -> ✅ Does she like coffee? (She uchun 'do' emas, 'does' ishlatiladi)","I goes to school. -> ✅ I go to school. (I olmoshi bilan fe'lga -es qo'shilmaydi)","They not work here. -> ✅ They do not work here. (Inkor gapda 'do' yordamchi fe'li shart)","She do not speak Uzbek. -> ✅ She does not speak Uzbek. (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda 'does' ishlatiladi)","We likes pizza. -> ✅ We like pizza. (We ko'plik bo'lgani uchun -s qo'shimchasi kerak emas)","Does you live in Tashkent? -> ✅ Do you live in Tashkent? (You uchun 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi)","He study English. -> ✅ He studies English. (y harfi bilan tugagan fe'llarda -ies qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi)","My brother eat apple. -> ✅ My brother eats an apple. (Birlikdagi shaxs uchun fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","They is happy. -> ✅ They are happy. (Ko'plik uchun 'is' emas, 'are' ishlatiladi)"],"level":"A1"},"topic":"Present Simple"},"teacher_username":"@axror","teacher_id":"6315515792","name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026"}},"students":{"7723214137":{"classrooms":["TOS-CYCX-G2SC-6B5D"],"name":"Ozodaxon Maxamadismonova"},"1465352022":{"classroo